WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Why do formulas use letters?

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.210
A formula is a recipe that works for any numbers.

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.090
Area = length × width.

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:16.900
A rug 3 metres by 2 metres: 3 × 2 is 6 square metres.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.013
Same recipe, any rug.
